xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn6-ehp-116-1469">a</xref> (402)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b20-ehp-116-1469">Stillman et al. (2007)</xref></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">China (2005)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02014;</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.17 (1.02&#x02013;4.63) (54)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn6-ehp-116-1469"><label>a</label><p>Mean (range).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>